  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="FR-04">The regarding-mode PCF is placed + form-configured on ALL 11 regarding-family entity forms (the exact set in `RegardingFieldMap.All`); each resolves the host record's `(entityType, id)`; deployed + smoke-verified on all 11. Scope: form placement/config/verification — no code change.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-024">The 11-entity set is exactly `RegardingFieldMap.All` — read it; MUST NOT invent or omit entities, and MUST NOT introduce a second regarding mechanism.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-006">Each placement binds the control (via `anchorField` → the entity's primary Name) to the form record (PCF for form binding).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-026">Path-A exception — OOB form + PCF, NOT a Code Page. Cite in the deploy PR.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-022">The deployed control uses React 16/17 platform libraries (verified in 021) — no per-form change; confirm the control loads under platform React on the forms.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Place via the `dataverse-deploy` skill / PAC; if environment auth/import blocks it, hand `pac import` + form-config to the owner and document the split. Deliverable = 11 placements + smoke evidence.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">No BFF publish-size / CVE obligation — deploy/config only, no BFF code (root §10 N/A). No shared-code or PCF-code edits here (020/021 own those).</constraint>
  </constraints>

