  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="1">Read `RegardingFieldMap.cs` to lock the exact 11-entity list + primary-Name field per entity (confirm `account`/`contact` OOB primary name vs `sprk_name` for the `sprk_` entities). Read the 021 `ControlManifest.Input.xml` for the bound `anchorField` + input properties, `PCF-DEPLOYMENT-GUIDE.md`, and ADR-024/ADR-006.</step>
    <step order="2">Import the task-021 solution ZIP to the target environment via the `dataverse-deploy` skill / PAC. If environment auth/import blocks it, prepare the import package + a written form-config runbook and hand to the owner — document the split in `current-task.md`.</step>
    <step order="3">For EACH of the 11 entities, add the regarding-mode `CommunicationTimeline` code component to the entity's main form: bind `anchorField` to that entity's primary Name, set the input properties (apiBaseUrl/tenant/clientApp/bffApp per the R1 config convention), position the control in a form section, and publish. Track a checklist row per entity.</step>
    <step order="4">Run the 11-entity smoke pass: open a record of each entity and confirm the control renders the grouped regarding view (threads-as-groups) with no console errors. Record pass/fail per entity.</step>
    <step order="5">Run UI tests via the `ui-test` skill in depth on ≥2 representative forms — `sprk_matter` (a `sprk_` entity) + `contact` (a non-`sprk_` OOB entity) — covering render, the grouped regarding view resolving the host record, and an ADR-021 dark-mode check.</step>
    <step order="9.5">FULL-rigor quality gates: `code-review` on any form-config artifacts / deploy notes (focus: exactly 11 entities placed, each `anchorField` bound to the correct primary Name, input properties correct, no second regarding mechanism); `adr-check` against ADR-024/ADR-006/ADR-026 + `spec.md` (FR-04 all-11, NFR-03 parity preserved — nothing on the form re-derives access). Address Critical + High findings.</step>
    <step order="10">Update `tasks/TASK-INDEX.md` (022 ✅) + `current-task.md`; record decisions (per-entity primary-Name field used, form/section placement, input-property values, the 11-row smoke matrix result, UI-test evidence for the 2 deep forms, and any import-vs-owner split).</step>
  </steps>

